     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Cool! Thanks for sharing.</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sat, Apr 11, 2015 at 9:37 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/israel-r-user-group/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/israel-r-user-group/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0mrgd1u5aw3gfsOlbGtHFp\">\r\n              israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:#dd4b39;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Qo_-NSqyNlvmSwjz6b3zo\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Qo_-NSqyNlvmSwjz6b3zo\"><img style=\"border:0;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:#f5f5f5\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:#222222;padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_3242896877782742664_14ca732f784d30d7_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    Topic digest\r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/israel-r-user-group/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/israel-r-user-group/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0mrgd1u5aw3gfsOlbGtHFp\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:#222222;padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_3242896877782742664_14ca732f784d30d7_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Statistical learning course</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_3242896877782742664_14ca732f784d30d7_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/israel-r-user-group/t/4fad03eaea73e0e9?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/israel-r-user-group/t/4fad03eaea73e0e9?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16hbFv5Uiy61NZEvEc5vEQ\">\r\n      Statistical learning course\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n    \r\n  </font></span><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n          Jonathan Rosenblatt &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jonathan....@weizmann.ac.il</a>&gt;: Apr 10 03:30PM +0300\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Dear all<br>\r\nI am attaching a link to the material of the Statistical Learning course I<br>\r\nam giving this semester at BGU.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/johnros/Intro2R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/johnros/Intro2R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rju68g4fwYECqiYs8FSK4\">https://github.com/johnros/Intro2R</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nIt is mostly an introduction to statistical learning, particularly with R.<br>\r\nAs you will see, it is under construction.<br>\r\nIt currently includes:<br>\r\n- Introductory script to R.<br>\r\n- Class notes.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nWithin the next few weeks it will include:<br>\r\n- Supervised and unsupervised learning examples in R.<br>\r\n- Dim reduction examples in R.<br>\r\n- Memory efficient implementations of learning algorithms (you guessed<br>\r\nit... in R).<br>\r\n <br>\r\nYou are welcome to fork, comment, suggest, and distribute.<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nJonathan Rosenblatt<br>\r\nPostdoctoral Researcher<br>\r\nFaculty of Mathematics and CS<br>\r\nWeizmann Institute of Science<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1LsdMWjJn9lLyWHnphpq4B\">www.john-ros.com</a><br>\r\n\r\n      </font></span></td></tr></tbody></table><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_3242896877782742664_14ca732f784d30d7_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:#636363;font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/israel-r-user-group/join\" style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/israel-r-user-group/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497367816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rUPLdSwGGhltRFg54KrPy\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a hr